    "detailed_description": "<u>Slenderman: Unbecoming</u> is a new adaptation on<i> Slenderman</i>, the paranormal phenomenon. Slenderman: Unbecoming is a singleplayer horror game, based on the narrative of one lone protagonist, haunted by Slenderman. The game contains several missions, which describe the disturbing events of a park ranger, and brings back The Butterfly Effect, which are user-driven choices to alter your future.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">What Will You Do? How Will You Survive? </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features:</h2><br>Using the Butterfly Effect, meaning your  in-game choices have consequences, you can play through the game making your own decisions.<br>Make the wrong decision, and you may pay the price. Story is driven by levels as a core mechanic. <br><br><br><strong>Your Survival is up to you. </strong>",
